# ── Knowledge graphs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Graphify rules ported from pfBlockerNG alongside scripts/agent/. The graph
# itself is committed so a fresh clone can query it without a rebuild;
# everything else in graphify-out/ is regenerated locally.
*.graphify-bak
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
!graphify-out/memory/

# CodeGraph's index is per-machine; .codegraph/ carries its own ignore file.
